      <div class="p-5 max-sm:p-4">
        <p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
          <span data-id="pg107_n0032">Mjedisi jet&#xeb;sor &#xeb;sht&#xeb; t&#xeb;r&#xeb; hap&#xeb;sira e natyr&#xeb;s, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n jetojm&#xeb;, punojm&#xeb;, l&#xeb;vizim dhe veprojm&#xeb;.</span>
          <span data-id="pg107_n0033">Njeriu, me sjelljen e tij, ndikon n&#xeb; ndryshimet q&#xeb; ndodhin n&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;.</span>
          <span data-id="pg107_n0034">Ato veprime mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; t&#xeb; d&#xeb;mshme apo t&#xeb; dobishme p&#xeb;r natyr&#xeb;n.</span>
          <span data-id="pg107_n0035">Mjedisi i past&#xeb;r siguron sh&#xeb;ndet t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjitha qeniet e gjalla q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; planetin ton&#xeb;.</span>
          <span data-id="pg107_n0036">&#xcb;sht&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;si e &#xe7;do qytetari t&#xeb; kontribuoj&#xeb; p&#xeb;r ruajtjen e mjedisit nga ndotja.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="adt-body mt-4 text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
          <span data-id="pg107_n0038">P&#xeb;r nj&#xeb; mjedis t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r, ne duhet t&#xeb; kursejm&#xeb; energjin&#xeb;, t&#xeb; udh&#xeb;tojm&#xeb; me bi&#xe7;iklet&#xeb; apo me transport publik, t&apos;i klasifikojm&#xeb; mbeturinat dhe t&#x2019;i hedhim ato n&#xeb; vendin e caktuar, ta kursejm&#xeb; ujin, ta gjelb&#xeb;rojm&#xeb; sa m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; mjedisin, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; kemi aj&#xeb;r t&#xeb; past&#xeb;r.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="adt-body mt-4 text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
          <span data-id="pg107_n0040">Njeriu duhet t&#x2019;i v&#xeb;r&#xeb; detyr&#xeb; vetes q&#xeb;, n&#xeb;se nuk mund t&#xeb; mbroj&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;n, s&#xeb; paku t&#xeb; mos e shkat&#xeb;rroj&#xeb; at&#xeb;!</span>
        </p>
      </div>
